                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "A Tooth Number",
                            "Rivet numbers each\ngear tooth so\ndamage can be\ndescribed exactly.",
                            "Once, a caller\nsaid the unhappy\nbit near the other\nunhappy bit.",
                            "Rivet walked\nacross town, fixed\nthe gear, and\nreturned with a",
                            "numbering punch.\nThe caller now\nteaches\napprentices how to\nuse it."
                          ],
